Z||000001||Joe Torma||08-28-2001||10:53 PM||||If you use a search engine(i don't remember the url) look for Fiero Sail Panels.<P>Or, rip off the cracked plastic...get some thin plexi, paint the back whatever color you want...and double sided tape them to the panel.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Rick 88||08-29-2001||02:37 AM||||You can purchase smoke tinted quarterwindows from Doug at the Fiero Warehouse. They are not factory but fit very well and are very durable. I have them on my car and have the side windows tinted to match. They give the car a really sharp look.<P>Rick<BR>yellow 88 GT 5-speed||||reg||1
